response:
The incident report describes a mass phishing campaign tracked as UAC-0041, distributing emails with subject Остаточний платіж and an archive attachment. The archive contains the .NET downloader RelicRace, which fetches and executes the installer malware RelicSource. RelicSource then decrypts and executes stealer payloads, specifically Formbook and Snake Keylogger.

